,"answer":"D","explanation":"under 是在下面。","verify":"\"在椅子下面\""},{"id":"cne_p045_q3","topicId":"cne_p045","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The cat is on the box. 猫在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在盒子上面"},{"key":"B","text":"在盒子里面"},{"key":"C","text":"在盒子下面"},{"key":"D","text":"在盒子后面"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"on 是在上面。","verify":"\"在盒子上面\""},{"id":"cne_p045_q4","topicId":"cne_p045","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Where is my car? 这句是在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"这是谁的小汽车"},{"key":"B","text":"我的小汽车在哪里"},{"key":"C","text":"小汽车是什么颜色"},{"key":"D","text":"你喜欢小汽车吗"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Where is 问位置。","verify":"\"我的小汽车在哪里\""},{"id":"cne_p046_q1","topicId":"cne_p046","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问书包在哪里，应说哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"What is my bag?"},{"key":"B","text":"Who is my bag?"},{"key":"C","text":"How is my bag?"},{"key":"D","text":"Where is my bag?"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"问位置用 Where is。","verify":"\"Where is my bag?\""},{"id":"cne_p046_q2","topicId":"cne_p046","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Where is the book? 若书在椅子上面，应回答哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It is on the chair."},{"key":"B","text":"It is in the chair."},{"key":"C","text":"It is under the chair."},{"key":"D","text":"It is the chair."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"上面用 on。","verify":"\"It is on the chair.\""},{"id":"cne_p046_q3","topicId":"cne_p046","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"It is in the desk. 东西在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在书桌上面"},{"key":"B","text":"在书桌里面"},{"key":"C","text":"在书桌下面"},{"key":"D","text":"在椅子旁边"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"in the desk 是在书桌里面。","verify":"\"在书桌里面\""},{"id":"cne_p046_q4","topicId":"cne_p046","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The ball is under the chair. 哪一句和这句话意思相同？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"球在椅子上面。"},{"key":"B","text":"书在椅子下面。"},{"key":"C","text":"球在椅子下面。"},{"key":"D","text":"球在书桌里面。"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"ball 是球，under the chair 是在椅子下面。","verify":"\"球在椅子下面。\""},{"id":"cne_p047_q1","topicId":"cne_p047","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：The book is on the desk. 书在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在书桌上面"},{"key":"B","text":"在书桌里面"},{"key":"C","text":"在书桌下面"},{"key":"D","text":"在椅子上面"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"on the desk 是在书桌上面。","verify":"\"在书桌上面\""},{"id":"cne_p047_q2","topicId":"cne_p047","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：My bag is under the chair. 哪一句和文字一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"书包在椅子上面。"},{"key":"B","text":"书包在椅子下面。"},{"key":"C","text":"书在椅子下面。"},{"key":"D","text":"书包在书桌里面。"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"bag 是书包，under the chair 是椅子下面。","verify":"\"书包在椅子下面。\""},{"id":"cne_p047_q3","topicId":"cne_p047","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：The pen is in the bag. 钢笔在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在书包上面"},{"key":"B","text":"在书包下面"},{"key":"C","text":"在书包里面"},{"key":"D","text":"在书桌上"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"in the bag 是在书包里面。","verify":"\"在书包里面\""},{"id":"cne_p047_q4","topicId":"cne_p047","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"文字：Where is the car? It is under the desk. 小汽车在哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在书桌上面"},{"key":"B","text":"在椅子上面"},{"key":"C","text":"在书包里面"},{"key":"D","text":"在书桌下面"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"回答写的是 under the desk。","verify":"\"在书桌下面\""},{"id":"cne_p076_q1","topicId":"cne_p076","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词含有长元音 e？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"ten"},{"key":"B","text":"he"},{"key":"C","text":"pen"},{"key":"D","text":"red"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"he 含有长元音 e。","verify":"\"he\""},{"id":"cne_p076_q2","topicId":"cne_p076","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词不含长元音 e？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"he"},{"key":"B","text":"she"},{"key":"C","text":"ten"},{"key":"D","text":"me"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"ten 不含长元音 e。","verify":"\"ten\""},{"id":"cne_p076_q3","topicId":"cne_p076","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"she 和哪个词的元音相同？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"ten"},{"key":"B","text":"pen"},{"key":"C","text":"red"},{"key":"D","text":"me"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"she 和 me 都含有长元音 e。","verify":"\"me\""},{"id":"cne_p076_q4","topicId":"cne_p076","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择含有长元音 e的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"we"},{"key":"B","text":"pen"},{"key":"C","text":"red"},{"key":"D","text":"leg"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"we 含有长元音 e。","verify":"\"we\""}]
